# The provenance of the Q4_0 bytes is machine-checkable: llama.cpp's own NumPy
# quantizer (gguf-py) re-quantizes the source tensor to byte-identical bytes.
$ python3 -c "... gguf.Q4_0.quantize_blocks(source) == committed_bytes ..."
  Q4_0   numpy_requantize_is_byte_identical = True
  Q4_K   unavailable (llama.cpp has no NumPy quantizer for this type)
  Q6_K   unavailable (llama.cpp has no NumPy quantizer for this type)

# The expected dequantized values come from llama.cpp's own NumPy *dequantizer*
